{"title":"Career Roadmap — Post-Harvest Technologist","role":"Post-Harvest Technologist","summary":"A Post-Harvest Technologist develops and improves technologies used after agricultural products are harvested, including cleaning, grading, drying, storage, packaging, cold chains, processing, quality preservation and loss reduction. The role combines agricultural engineering, food technology, mechanical systems, refrigeration, automation and quality control.","facts":{},"about":[{"label":"Direct alignment","text":"Very High — Agricultural Engineering provides a strong foundation in farm machinery, agricultural processing, storage, refrigeration, fluid mechanics and engineering systems. Adding food science and post-harvest technology is essential for specialised roles."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Agricultural engineering, crop science, food properties, processing, storage and post-harvest systems"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Post-Harvest Technologist → Processing Engineer → Senior Post-Harvest Engineer"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Post-Harvest Specialist, Cold-Chain Manager, Processing/R&D Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Post-Harvest Technology Head, Food/Agri Processing Director, Supply-Chain Technology Specialist"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Core learning","Practical outcome"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Mathematics, physics, chemistry, agricultural fundamentals"},{"text":"Understand agricultural systems"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Farm machinery, fluid mechanics, thermodynamics, crop properties"},{"text":"Understand handling and storage systems"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Food/agricultural processing, drying, storage, refrigeration, packaging"},{"text":"Design post-harvest systems"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Cold chain, automation, quality, processing economics and R&D"},{"text":"Develop an end-to-end post-harvest solution"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Agricultural & Engineering Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Basic agricultural science"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"},{"text":"Mechanical fundamentals"},{"text":"Electrical fundamentals"},{"text":"Programming basics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Technical communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the post-harvest chain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Harvest","Cleaning","Sorting","Grading","Drying","Storage","Processing","Packaging","Transportation","Market"]},{"type":"h","text":"Mini-project"},{"type":"p","text":"Measure how different storage conditions affect a selected crop's:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Moisture"},{"text":"Weight"},{"text":"Appearance"},{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Spoilage rate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Agricultural Engineering Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Farm machinery"},{"text":"Agricultural processing"},{"text":"Fluid mechanics"},{"text":"Thermodynamics"},{"text":"Heat transfer"},{"text":"Soil and water engineering"},{"text":"Agricultural structures"},{"text":"Crop properties"},{"text":"Engineering properties of biological materials"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grain handling"},{"text":"Conveyors"},{"text":"Elevators"},{"text":"Pumps"},{"text":"Fans"},{"text":"Dryers"},{"text":"Storage structures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a small grain drying and storage system."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Crop","Moisture measurement","Drying","Cooling","Storage","Monitoring"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Post-Harvest Specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Processing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cleaning"},{"text":"Sorting"},{"text":"Grading"},{"text":"Milling"},{"text":"Dehusking"},{"text":"Crushing"},{"text":"Separation"},{"text":"Size reduction"},{"text":"Food/agricultural processing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Drying"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sun drying"},{"text":"Mechanical drying"},{"text":"Tray drying"},{"text":"Fluidised-bed drying"},{"text":"Hot-air drying"},{"text":"Moisture control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Storage"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Silos"},{"text":"Hermetic storage"},{"text":"Controlled atmosphere"},{"text":"Modified atmosphere"},{"text":"Temperature/humidity monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cold Chain"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Refrigeration"},{"text":"Cold storage"},{"text":"Pre-cooling"},{"text":"Controlled-temperature transportation"},{"text":"Fresh produce preservation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Technology, Quality & Commercialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Packaging technology"},{"text":"Food quality"},{"text":"Shelf-life analysis"},{"text":"Post-harvest loss assessment"},{"text":"HACCP fundamentals"},{"text":"Quality management"},{"text":"Sensors and IoT"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Cold-chain monitoring"},{"text":"Supply-chain management"},{"text":"Technology economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Smart Post-Harvest Management System."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IoT grain-storage monitoring"},{"text":"AI-based fruit grading"},{"text":"Smart cold-storage system"},{"text":"Solar crop dryer"},{"text":"Intelligent warehouse"},{"text":"Automated sorting system"},{"text":"Spoilage prediction system"},{"text":"Smart packaging"},{"text":"Low-cost rural storage technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Project flow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Crop","Harvest","Processing","Storage","Monitoring","Quality prediction","Packaging","D