ive Spoilage","Automated Processing","Digital Cold Chain"]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["Agricultural Engineer","Post-Harvest Technologist","Food/Cold-Chain Specialist","Agri-Tech Engineer"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This pathway is particularly valuable for food processing, cold-chain logistics, agricultural exports, warehousing, agri-tech, food technology and post-harvest R&D, with strong future opportunities in reducing food loss through automation and intelligent storage systems."}]}]}